<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i>
			or <i>from Thasos</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσιος</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>) <i>Thasian wine</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				82.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				317
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσιον οἴνου σταμνίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					196
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1119
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσια κάρυα</span>
			<i>almonds</i>, Chrysipp.Tyan. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.37
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσια</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1097d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.188
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				10.57
			</span></i> tit.: in sg., ib.<i><span class="en">
				76.6
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Θασία ἅλμη</span>
			<i>pickled sea-fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				6
			</span></i>; and without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμη, ἀνακυκᾶν
				Θασίαν</span> to make <i>this pickle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				671
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσιος, ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), name of month at Temnos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Wiener Denkschr.</u>
				53.96
			</span></i> (prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θάσιον, τό</span>, a measure in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				12.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, al.</div>
